    SubscriptBox["\[Beta]", "5"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bd52e486-dcc3-5647-b26e-f0e85ea78505"],
 " that satisfy that section of \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]a\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], then a[[7]] is the best result. We analyze it below \
numerically and then symbolically"
}], "Subsubsection",
